<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif; width: 100%; background-color: #F3F4F6; line-height: 1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;">
    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="background-color: #F3F4F6;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <div style="max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;">
            <!-- Header -->
            <div style="background-color: #10365A; padding: 32px 32px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 3px solid #0E7FC2;">
              <img
                src="https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/o/laigusbucket%2Fjobsite-credential-logo.png?alt=media&token=9d81b484-ab4b-41f0-b7cb-d88f2287b340"
                alt="CVtoCAREER Logo"
                style="display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 149px; height: 32px;"
              />
            </div>

            <!-- Body -->
            <div style="padding: 40px 36px;">
              <div style="background-color: #F0F7FF; border-left: 5px solid #0E7FC2; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 0 0 24px; text-align: center;">
                <div style="font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 8px;">⏳</div>
                <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #1F2937; font-size: 16px;">One more step</p>
              </div>

              <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #4B5563;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">Dear <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">We have received <strong><%= email %></strong>. It is now <strong>pending approval</strong>.</p>

                <div style="background-color: #F0F7FF; border-left: 5px solid #0E7FC2; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
                  <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 500; color: #1F2937;">What we still need from you</p>
                  <p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-weight: 400; color: #4B5563;">
                    Grant CVtoCAREER <strong>delegated access</strong> to this mailbox. Until you do,
                    <strong>we cannot apply for any roles on your behalf</strong> — your job search has
                    not started.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div style="background-color: #F0FDF8; border-left: 5px solid #0F9D6C; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; color: #1F2937;">
                  <p style="margin: 0;">
                    <strong>We do NOT want your password.</strong> We will never ask for it. We generate
                    our own passwords for the jobsite accounts we open in your name. All we
                    need from you is the address — and delegated access to it.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <a href="<%= frontendUrl %>" style="display: block; margin-top: 24px; padding: 15px 32px; background-color: #0E7FC2; background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, #0E7FC2 0%, #0B5A94 100%); color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; text-align: center;">I have delegated access →</a>

                <div style="height: 1px; background-color: #E5E7EB; margin: 24px 0;"></div>

                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4B5563;">Kind regards,<br />The CVtoCAREER Team</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <div style="padding: 20px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #E5E7EB; text-align: center;">
              <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9CA3AF;">
                &copy; <%= currentYear %> CVtoCAREER. All rights reserved.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
